":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An employee of the Warehouse 22 security firm. He's considered resigning, but fears ending up next on his colleagues' hit list.\nPrefers being a private soldier for a perfumed noble to being an unidentified corpse found in a pipe. At the very least, he wasn't assigned to that smelly fool Gromov.","abilities":["Sticks close to <Pavlovich, Magistrate> when he is making a speech, and retreats when Pavlovich is dead","When any unit is discovered by Sentry Turrets, increases Movement Speed and dashes towards the discovered unit within a large search range","Nearby enemies take reduced Physical and Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":50000,"atk":700,"def":2000,"res":50,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"pavlovich_magistrate":{"slug":"pavlovich_magistrate","name":"Pavlovich, Magistrate","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pavlovich, Magistrate.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Someone who firmly believes he has done nothing wrong. There are about a hundred or so people like him sitting in the Duma.","abilities":["[Civil Servant of the Empire Exemption Act] Takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage","[Deity Grypherburg Public Opinion Clarification Act] Allied Operators discovered by Sentry Turrets are locked up in Cell when retreated or defeated; imprisoned Operators cannot be redeployed until their Cell is destroyed","[Magistrate Personal Safety Clause] When an allied unit is in his attack range, Sentry Turrets will turn towards that unit","'Empire's Conscience'","[Spontaneous Mobilization] Periodically makes speeches. Loses Damage Reduction effect while speaking, but continuously summons enemies around him and grants combat buffs to enemy units within range","[Frontline Inspection] When making a speech, calls 'Personal Security Consultants' back to his side","'Bastion of Turbulence'","[Spontaneous Mobilization] Summons stronger enemy unit(s)","[Explosive Counterargument] Calls for air support, bombarding zones where the Sentry Turrets' alert is triggered and dealing a percentage of ATK as Arts damage and Burn to allied units in the area; also illuminates the tiles, dealing continuous Burn and temporarily disabling Disguise Kits used by units on those tiles","[Peaceful Quarantine Zone Management Plan] After 6 minutes, unleashes a bombardment dealing lethal damage to all units"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":60000,"atk":1200,"def":600,"res":15,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3.5}},"crowbar_patrolman":{"slug":"crowbar_patrolman","name":"Crowbar Patrolman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Crowbar Patrolman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Someone who mistakes recklessness for courage. The Sixteen Warriors have never had a dress code, but everyone simply chose to wear stripes of their own accord.","abilities":["When any unit is discovered by Sentry Turrets, increases Movement Speed and dashes towards the discovered unit within a certain search range"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.75,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":350,"def":80,"res":0,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.8}},"scrapmetal_destroyer":{"slug":"scrapmetal_destroyer","name":"Scrapmetal Destroyer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Scrapmetal Destroyer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Someone who boasts of knowing aerodynamics better than the students at the University of Deity Grypherburg. Her unpublished 'Imprisoned Scholar Thesis' is about blowing paper balls at napping officers with a straw.","abilities":["Prioritizes units discovered by Sentry Turrets re